124
00:06:07,088 --> 00:06:10,488
Oh, yeah! Feaked your interest, huh?

125
00:06:10,488 --> 00:06:11,488
Not really.

126
00:06:11,488 --> 00:06:14,088
Hmph. Too bad. We're looking at it.

127
00:06:15,288 --> 00:06:16,688
Oh, your yearbook.

128
00:06:17,088 --> 00:06:20,888
Wow. I didn't think I'd get to peek at a old yearbook this soon.

129
00:06:21,688 --> 00:06:22,288
There.

130
00:06:22,288 --> 00:06:24,488
Oh, it's so you.

131
