205
00:10:27,488 --> 00:10:34,288
They knew you would cheer up and ultimately keep moving on.

206
00:10:38,288 --> 00:10:39,288
Oh, line.

207
00:10:39,288 --> 00:10:41,288
When did I get so many messages?

208
00:10:41,288 --> 00:10:42,288
What's wrong?

209
00:10:42,288 --> 00:10:45,288
