214
00:10:51,288 --> 00:10:52,288
Well, no.

215
00:10:52,288 --> 00:10:53,288
But even still...

216
00:10:53,288 --> 00:10:55,288
I mean...

217
00:10:55,288 --> 00:10:56,288
Come on.

218
00:10:56,288 --> 00:10:58,088
Look how I'm dressed.

219
00:10:58,088 --> 00:11:00,088
If I'm to meet her, I want to be dressed right.

220
00:11:00,088 --> 00:11:02,088
Oh, you're right.

221
00:11:02,088 --> 00:11:03,088
Then maybe...

222
00:11:03,088 --> 00:11:05,088
