226
00:11:14,088 --> 00:11:16,088
Welcome home!

227
00:11:16,088 --> 00:11:18,088
Do you have a friend over?

228
00:11:18,088 --> 00:11:19,088
Yeah.

229
00:11:19,088 --> 00:11:20,088
She's here.

230
00:11:20,088 --> 00:11:20,888
Yeah?

231
