259
00:12:19,488 --> 00:12:21,488
What's he like?

260
00:12:21,488 --> 00:12:23,488
I mean...

261
00:12:23,488 --> 00:12:25,488
He's a bit...

262
00:12:25,488 --> 00:12:26,488
like, um...

263
00:12:26,488 --> 00:12:28,488
Is he...

264
00:12:28,488 --> 00:12:29,488
like you?

265
00:12:29,488 --> 00:12:30,488
No, he's...

266
00:12:30,488 --> 00:12:31,488
He's delicious!

267
00:12:33,488 --> 00:12:34,488
Poster here!

268
00:12:34,488 --> 00:12:35,488
Anna!

269
00:12:35,488 --> 00:12:36,488
Oh, hey!

270
00:12:36,488 --> 00:12:37,688
What's the matter, Mom?

271
00:12:37,688 --> 00:12:39,488
Is that hot pot okay with Qi?

272
00:12:39,488 --> 00:12:40,688
Does she have any allergies?

273
00:12:40,688 --> 00:12:41,688
Uh, she's fine.

274
00:12:41,688 --> 00:12:43,688
Anna ate most of it anyway.

275
00:12:43,688 --> 00:12:45,688
Um, thanks for having me over.

276
00:12:45,688 --> 00:12:47,688
Are you all right?

277
00:12:47,688 --> 00:12:48,688
I'm fine.

278
00:12:48,688 --> 00:12:50,688
I sure hope so.

279
00:12:50,688 --> 00:12:52,688
But the snow's still coming down.

280
00:12:52,688 --> 00:12:54,688
So don't stay too late.

281
00:12:59,688 --> 00:13:00,688
Sorry.

282
00:13:01,688 --> 00:13:03,688
No, I'm the one who should be saying that.

283
00:13:03,688 --> 00:13:05,688
Hm?

284
00:13:05,688 --> 00:13:06,888
